        "semantic_kind": "課題",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 630",
        "original_text": "未解決OrderのSlotやreservationをTTL・停止だけで解放すると、同じ資源を別Tradeへ二重割当し得る。"
      },
      {
        "coverage_id": "SDD-L0654",
        "semantic_kind": "課題",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 654",
        "original_text": "Brokerで成立した事実をProposalの有効性判定と混同すると、TTL失効やPolicy変更を理由に現実の約定を失い得る。"
      }
    ],
    "purposes": [
      {
        "coverage_id": "SDD-L0632",
        "semantic_kind": "目的",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 632",
        "original_text": "Broker上の確定事実と整合するまでOrder状態と資源予約を保持する。"
      },
      {
        "coverage_id": "SDD-L0656",
        "semantic_kind": "目的",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 656",
        "original_text": "事実受領とCompliance評価を分離し、PortfolioをBroker現実へ一致させる。"
      }
    ],
    "design_reasons": [],
    "processes": [
      {
        "coverage_id": "SDD-L0634",
        "semantic_kind": "対象",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 634",
        "original_text": "Order状態、execution_slot、BUY費用予約、SELL数量予約。"
      },
      {
        "coverage_id": "SDD-L0638",
        "semantic_kind": "table_row",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 638",
        "original_text": "| AWAITING_SUBMISSION | 承認後、Broker未操作 | execution_slotとBUY最大支払額＋費用余裕またはSELL数量を保持 |"
      },
      {
        "coverage_id": "SDD-L0639",
        "semantic_kind": "table_row",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 639",
        "original_text": "| ORDER_OPEN | Brokerへ発注済み | Slot・残予約を保持 |"
      },
      {
        "coverage_id": "SDD-L0640",
        "semantic_kind": "table_row",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 640",
        "original_text": "| PARTIALLY_FILLED | 一部約定 | FactごとにPosition / Cash / 残予約更新 |"
      },
      {
        "coverage_id": "SDD-L0641",
        "semantic_kind": "table_row",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 641",
        "original_text": "| CANCEL_PENDING | 取消依頼、未確定 | 予約を解放しない |"
      },
      {
        "coverage_id": "SDD-L0642",
        "semantic_kind": "table_row",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 642",
        "original_text": "| FILLED | 全約定 | 累計数量照合後に終了処理 |"
      },
      {
        "coverage_id": "SDD-L0643",
        "semantic_kind": "table_row",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 643",
        "original_text": "| CANCELLED / REJECTED | Broker確定 | 全約定累計と取消数量を照合して残予約解放 |"
      },
      {
        "coverage_id": "SDD-L0644",
        "semantic_kind": "table_row",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 644",
        "original_text": "| UNKNOWN | 状況不明 | TTLや停止だけでSlot / reservationを解放しない |"
